'g1' is a group; JUSTIFIED is for an elementary item (X3.23-1985 JUSTIFIED syntax rule 1)
'e1' is alphanumeric-edited; JUSTIFIED is not for an edited item (X3.23-1985 JUSTIFIED syntax rule 3)
'g2' is a group; SYNCHRONIZED is for an elementary item until COBOL 2023 (X3.23-1985 SYNCHRONIZED syntax rule 1)
the group 'g3' has a SIGN clause but no signed numeric DISPLAY item below it (X3.23-1985 SIGN syntax rule 1)
